<section class="panel mb-4">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start gap-3 mb-3"><div><h2 class="mb-1">Router portal features</h2><p class="muted mb-0">Defaults inherited by every station. Coin, voucher, member login and trial may all be enabled together.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="/admin/portal-emulator">Test portal</a></div>
